 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "再看另一半：签名。",
   "spoken": "再看另一半：签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.84,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 3.285
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "很多操作不在链上发起，而是在链下签名，再交给合约验证。",
   "spoken": "很多操作不在链上发起，而是在链下签名，再交给合约验证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-01.wav",
   "start": 3.66,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 3.66,
   "speechEnd": 8.867
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "免 gas 授权 permit、元交易、订单簿挂单、跨链桥验证者签名、空投领取凭证，都是这样。",
   "spoken": "免 gas 授权 permit、元交易、订单簿挂单、跨链桥验证者签名、空投领取凭证，都是这样。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-02.wav",
   "start": 9.24,
   "dur": 8.56,
   "speechStart": 9.343,
   "speechEnd": 17.568
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "问题是，一份签名，能被用几次？",
   "spoken": "问题是，一份签名，能被用几次？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-03.wav",
   "start": 18.02,
   "dur": 2.96,
   "speechStart": 18.02,
   "speechEnd": 20.799
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "打个比方。你签了一张支付 100 元的支票。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。你签了一张支付 100 元的支票。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-04.wav",
   "start": 21.48,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 21.578,
   "speechEnd": 25.027
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "没写日期，没写收款银行，没写支票编号。",
   "spoken": "没写日期，没写收款银航，没写支票编号。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-05.wav",
   "start": 25.46,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 25.558,
   "speechEnd": 29.278
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "拿到它的人，可以复印很多份，去每一家银行各兑一次。",
   "spoken": "拿到它的人，可以复印很多份，去每一家银航各兑一次。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-06.wav",
   "start": 29.68,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 29.68,
   "speechEnd": 34.083
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "比喻在这里不完全成立：银行会自己记下兑过的支票。合约不会，除非代码让它记。",
   "spoken": "比喻在这里不完全成立：银航会自己记下兑过的支票。合约不会，除非代码让它记。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-07.wav",
   "start": 34.54,
   "dur": 7.76,
   "speechStart": 34.637,
   "speechEnd": 42.042
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "一份安全的签名，要绑定五个字段。",
   "spoken": "一份安全的签名，要绑定五个字段。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-08.wav",
   "start": 42.52,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speechStart": 42.52,
   "speechEnd": 45.344
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "第一，nonce，一次性编号。缺了它，同一份签名可以在同一个合约反复提交。",
   "spoken": "第一，nonce，一次性编号。缺了它，同一份签名可以在同一个合约反复提交。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-09.wav",
   "start": 45.78,
   "dur": 6.8,
   "speechStart": 45.873,
   "speechEnd": 52.403
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "第二，链 ID。缺了它，签名在分叉链和多链部署上同样有效。",
   "spoken": "第二，链 ID。缺了它，签名在分叉链和多链部署上同样有效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-10.wav",
   "start": 52.8,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 52.899,
   "speechEnd": 57.99
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "第三，合约地址。缺了它，同一份代码部署两次，签名在两个合约都有效。",
   "spoken": "第三，合约地址。缺了它，同一份代码部署两次，签名在两个合约都有效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-11.wav",
   "start": 58.38,
   "dur": 7.04,
   "speechStart": 58.38,
   "speechEnd": 65.182
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "第四，截止时间。缺了它，签名永久有效。你改主意以后，它照样能被使用。",
   "spoken": "第四，截止时间。缺了它，签名永久有效。你改主意以后，它照样能被使用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-12.wav",
   "start": 65.64,
   "dur": 7.76,
   "speechStart": 65.734,
   "speechEnd": 73.214
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "第五，函数意图，也就是类型哈希。缺了它，给 A 函数签的数据，会被拿去调用 B 函数。",
   "spoken": "第五，函数意图，也就是类型哈希。缺了它，给 A 函数签的数据，会被拿去掉用 B 函数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-13.wav",
   "start": 73.62,
   "dur": 8.48,
   "speechStart": 73.716,
   "speechEnd": 81.91
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-14.wav",
   "start": 82.32,
   "dur": 1.04,
   "speechStart": 82.32,
   "speechEnd": 83.128
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "一张领取凭证，绑定了 nonce，没有绑定链 ID。",
   "spoken": "一张领取凭证，绑定了 nonce，没有绑定链 ID。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-15.wav",
   "start": 83.58,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 83.679,
   "speechEnd": 87.771
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "同一份合约，用相同的地址，部署在以太坊和 BNB Chain。",
   "spoken": "同一份合约，用相同的地址，部署在以太坊和 BNB Chain。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-16.wav",
   "start": 88.2,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 88.297,
   "speechEnd": 93.155
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "凭证在以太坊用过之后，还能在 BNB Chain 领取吗？",
   "spoken": "凭证在以太坊用过之后，还能在 BNB Chain 领取吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-17.wav",
   "start": 93.62,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 93.62,
   "speechEnd": 97.374
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "能。两条链上的 nonce 各自计数，BNB Chain 上还是 0。",
   "spoken": "能。两条链上的 nonce 各自计数，BNB Chain 上还是 0。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-18.wav",
   "start": 98.04,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 98.04,
   "speechEnd": 103.097
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "摘要里没有链 ID，两条链算出的摘要完全相同。",
   "spoken": "摘要里没有链 ID，两条链算出的摘要完全相同。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-19.wav",
   "start": 103.54,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 103.638,
   "speechEnd": 107.4
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-20",
   "text": "解决办法是 EIP-712。",
   "spoken": "解决办法是 EIP-712。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-20.wav",
   "start": 107.84,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 107.84,
   "speechEnd": 110.06
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-21",
   "text": "它把名称、版本、链 ID、合约地址，合成一个域分隔符。",
   "spoken": "它把名称、版本、链 ID、合约地址，合成一个域分隔符。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-21.wav",
   "start": 110.46,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 110.46,
   "speechEnd": 116.204
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-22",
   "text": "再把消息的结构，合成类型哈希。",
   "spoken": "再把消息的结构，合成类型哈希。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-22.wav",
   "start": 116.6,
   "dur": 2.96,
   "speechStart": 116.6,
   "speechEnd": 119.368
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-23",
   "text": "用对 EIP-712，后四个字段一次解决。nonce 还要合约自己维护，每用一次，加一。",
   "spoken": "用对 EIP-712，后四个字段一次解决。nonce 还要合约自己维护，每用一次，加一。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-23.wav",
